This plugin includes material adapted from Anthropic's cookbook "Dreaming with a dynamic
workflow" (https://github.com/anthropics/claude-cookbooks, managed_agents), used under the
MIT License below:

- agents/analyzer.md is adapted from prompts/analyzer_system.md
- agents/organizer.md is adapted from prompts/organizer_system.md
- scripts/dream_workflow.tmpl.js and skills/dream/SKILL.md carry the rules of
  prompts/work_request.md and prompts/lead_system.md
- scripts/transcripts.py renders transcripts in the cookbook's plain-text export format

Changes from the originals: file paths; the memory format follows Claude Code's native auto
memory (frontmatter `name`, `description`, `metadata.type`; MEMORY.md lines
"- [Title](file.md) — hook", read up to 200 lines or 25KB) instead of `_index.md`; the transcript
format paragraph describes Claude Code exports; the workflow is generated by a script instead
of written by a lead agent.

